<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Just For Your One Smile 🌙</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=Great+Vibes&display=swap');

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    background:#07070d;
    color:#f4e9ed;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* ⭐ STARS */

body::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle,#ffffff 1px,transparent 1.5px),
    radial-gradient(circle,#dcb9c8 1px,transparent 1.5px);
    background-size:90px 90px,150px 150px;
    background-position:20px 30px,70px 90px;
    opacity:.25;
    animation:stars 15s linear infinite;
    z-index:0;
}

@keyframes stars{
    from{transform:translateY(0)}
    to{transform:translateY(90px)}
}

/* 🌙 MOON */

.moon{
    position:absolute;
    width:170px;
    height:170px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#f5eadc;
    right:-60px;
    top:70px;
    box-shadow:0 0 70px rgba(255,220,230,.25);
}

.moon::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    width:160px;
    height:160px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#07070d;
    left:35px;
    top:-12px;
}

/* 🔐 PASSWORD */

#lockScreen{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.lockContent{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    width:100%;
    max-width:520px;
}

.smallTitle{
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    color:#bca8af;
}

h1{
    font-size:65px;
    line-height:.85;
    font-weight:400;
    margin:25px 0;
}

.script{
    font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;
    color:#e5bdca;
}

.for{
    font-size:24px;
}

.hint{
    color:#aaa0a5;
    font-size:18px;
    font-style:italic;
}

.passwordBox{
    margin-top:30px;
    padding:20px;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    border-radius:20px;
    background:rgba(20,18,27,.8);
    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
}

input{
    width:100%;
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    background:#08080d;
    color:white;
    font-size:15px;
    outline:none;
    text-align:center;
}

button{
    margin-top:12px;
    padding:13px 25px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:#d9b8c2;
    color:#181118;
    font-weight:bold;
    cursor:pointer;
}

#error{
    color:#df899d;
    min-height:20px;
}

/* 📖 SCRAPBOOK */

#scrapbook{
    display:none;
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
}

.cover{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px;
}

.cover h1{
    font-size:75px;
}

.coverText{
    font-size:22px;
    color:#c6b7bd;
}

.date{
    margin-top:15px;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    font-size:12px;
    color:#a9959d;
}

.openButton{
    margin-top:35px;
    background:transparent;
    color:#e7c6cf;
    border:1px solid #e7c6cf66;
}

/* 📜 PAGES */

.page{
    width:90%;
    max-width:850px;
    margin:60px auto;
    padding:45px 30px;
    background:
    linear-gradient(145deg,#17131c,#0c0b11);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    border-radius:25px;
    box-shadow:0 20px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
}

.chapter{
    color:#cdaab5;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
}

.page h2{
    font-size:52px;
    font-weight:400;
    margin:15px 0;
}

.lead{
    font-size:22px;
    color:#bdb1b5;
    line-height:1.4;
}

/* 🗓 TIMELINE */

.memory{
    margin-top:20px;
    padding:20px;
    border:1px dashed #d9b8c233;
    border-radius:18px;
    background:#111019;
}

.memoryDate{
    color:#d3aeb9;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
}

.memory h3{
    font-size:25px;
    margin:7px 0;
    font-weight:500;
}

.memory p{
    color:#a9a0a5;
    font-size:17px;
}

/* 💌 NOTES */

.note{
    margin-top:15px;
    padding:22px;
    background:#111019;
    border:1px dashed #d9b8c233;
    border-radius:18px;
    font-size:23px;
}

/* ✉️ LETTER */

.letter{
    font-size:24px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:#cbbdc2;
}

/* 🌌 END */

.end{
    text-align:center;
    padding:100px 20px;
}

.end h2{
    font-size:42px;
    font-weight:400;
}

.end p{
    color:#a99ca2;
}

/* 📱 MOBILE */

@media(max-width:600px){

    h1{
        font-size:48px;
    }

    .cover h1{
        font-size:55px;
    }

    .page{
        padding:35px 22px;
    }

    .page h2{
        font-size:40px;
    }

    .gallery{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .moon{
        width:120px;
        height:120px;
        right:-50px;
    }

    .moon::after{
        width:115px;
        height:115px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- 🔐 PASSWORD SCREEN -->

<section id="lockScreen">

<div class="moon"></div>

<div class="lockContent">

<div class="smallTitle">
A PRIVATE LITTLE UNIVERSE
</div>

<h1>
Just For<br>
<span class="script">Your One Smile</span>
</h1>

<div class="for">
for <b>Meraa Betu</b> ♡
</div>

<p class="hint">
This little world is only for you.
</p>

<div class="passwordBox">

<input
id="password"
type="password"
placeholder="♡ enter the secret password ♡"
>

<button onclick="unlock()">
UNLOCK OUR STORY ♡
</button>

<p id="error"></p>

</div>

</div>
</section>


<!-- 📖 SCRAPBOOK -->

<section id="scrapbook">

<div class="cover">

<div class="smallTitle">
OUR LITTLE UNIVERSE
</div>

<h1>
Just For<br>
<span class="script">Your One Smile</span>
</h1>

<p class="coverText">
A little collection of everything that reminds me of you.
</p>

<div class="for">
for Meraa Betu ♡
</div>

<div class="date">
02 NOV 2023 — ∞
</div>

<button
class="openButton"
onclick="document.getElementById('story').scrollIntoView()">
OPEN OUR STORY →
</button>

</div>


<!-- 01 -->

<div class="page" id="story">

<div class="chapter">
01 / ONCE UPON A TIME
</div>

<h2>
It started with us.
</h2>

<p class="lead">
Some stories are written. Ours just happened —
and somehow became my favourite.
</p>

<div class="memory">

<div class="memoryDate">
02 NOV 2023
</div>

<h3>
When our story began ♡
</h3>

<p>
The day two people became a story.
</p>

</div>

<div class="memory">

<div class="memoryDate">
02 JAN 2024
</div>

<h3>
Us, officially.
</h3>

<p>
The day everything became a little more ours.
</p>

</div>

<div class="memory">

<div class="memoryDate">
02 JAN 2025
</div>

<h3>
Our first meeting.
</h3>

<p>
A memory worth keeping forever.
</p>

</div>

<div class="memory">

<div class="memoryDate">
13 JUN 2025
</div>

<h3>
Another little piece of us.
</h3>

<p>
One more date I never want to forget.
</p>

</div>

</div>


<!-- 02 -->

<div class="page">

<div class="chapter">
02 / LITTLE PIECES OF US
</div>

</>
<div class="caption">
another little piece of our story
</div>
</>

</>

</div>


<!-- 03 -->

<div class="page">

<div class="chapter">
03 / THINGS I NEVER GET TIRED OF that's to make you happy forver and
</div>

<h2>
Little things about you.
</h2>

<div class="note">
♡ The way you make ordinary moments feel special.
</div>

<div class="note">
♡ The memories that somehow become my favourite ones.
</div>

<div class="note">
♡ The smile this entire scrapbook was made for. coz may it worth of... 
</div>

<div class="note">
♡ The fact that somehow, you became my favourite person.
</div>

</div>


<!-- 04 -->

<div class="page">

<div class="chapter">
04 / IF YOU EVER FORGET
</div>

<h2>
A letter for you.
</h2>

<div class="letter">

<p>
Meraa Betu,
</p>

<p>
This page is going to hold everything
I sometimes don't know how to say out loud.
</p>

<p>
And if you ever forget how special you are to me,
come back here.
</p>

<p>
Because this entire little universe exists
just for your one smile. ♡
</p>

</div>

</div>


<!-- END -->

<div class="end">

<p>
UNTIL THE LAST PAGE 🌙
</p>

<h2>
Made just for your one smile.
</h2>

<p>
♡
</p>

</div>

</section>


<script>

function unlock(){

let password =
document.getElementById("password").value
.trim()
.toLowerCase();

if(password === "you are my good luck charm"){

document.getElementById("lockScreen").style.display="none";

document.getElementById("scrapbook").style.display="block";

window.scrollTo(0,0);

}else{

document.getElementById("error").innerHTML=
"That's not the secret password ♡";

}

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
